+    <section anchor="security-considerations" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-7">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-security-considerations">Security Considerations</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-7-1">Since the local time zone of a site may be useful for determining a
+time when systems are less likely to be monitored and might be more
+susceptible to a security probe, some sites may wish to emit times in
+UTC only.  Others might consider this to be loss of useful
+functionality at the hands of paranoia.</t>
+    </section>
